Below is a **complete, end‑to‑end blueprint** for building a modern e‑commerce front‑end.  
It covers the whole stack (design → tech → architecture → deployment) and gives you **ready‑to‑copy code snippets** for the most common pages and components.  
Feel free to copy, paste, and adapt – the patterns are reusable across all the UI pieces you listed.

---

## 1. Planning & Design

| Step | What to do | Why |
|------|------------|-----|
| **User flows** | Sketch checkout, login, product detail, cart, etc. | Guarantees a smooth UX. |
| **Wireframes** | Use Figma/Sketch → export assets. | Visual reference for developers. |
| **Design system** | Create tokens (colors, spacing, typography). | Consistency & easier theme changes. |
| **Accessibility audit** | Check contrast, ARIA roles, keyboard nav. | Inclusive & SEO‑friendly. |

---

## 2. Tech Stack (recommended)

| Layer | Tool | Reason |
|-------|------|--------|
| **Framework** | **React** (Next.js) | Server‑side rendering, file‑based routing, ISR. |
| **State** | **Zustand** (or Redux Toolkit) | Simple API, no boilerplate. |
| **Styling** | **Tailwind CSS** + **Headless UI** | Rapid styling, accessible primitives. |
| **Form** | **React Hook Form** + **Zod** | Validation, minimal re‑renders. |
| **API** | **Axios** or **SWR** | Data fetching + caching. |
| **Auth** | **NextAuth.js** | OAuth + JWT, easy session handling. |
| **Payments** | **Stripe Elements** | PCI‑compliant, secure. |
| **Testing** | **Jest + React Testing Library** | Unit tests. <br> **Cypress** | E2E tests. |
| **CI/CD** | **GitHub Actions** | Build, test, lint, deploy. |
| **Hosting** | **Vercel** (or Netlify) | Zero‑config, instant preview. |
| **Analytics** | **Google Analytics** + **Sentry** | User behavior + error tracking. |

---

## 3. Project Structure

```
my-ecommerce/
├─ public/
│  ├─ images/
│  └─ favicon.ico
├─ src/
│  ├─ components/
│  │  ├─ ui/          # Reusable UI primitives (Button, Modal, Toast, etc.)
│  │  ├─ layout/      # Header, Footer, Nav, Grid, ThemeProvider
│  │  ├─ pages/       # ProductList, ProductDetail, Cart, Checkout, Auth, etc.
│  │  └─ widgets/     # SearchBar, Filter, Pagination, Rating, Review, Wishlist, Carousel
│  ├─ hooks/
│  ├─ store/
│  ├─ lib/
│  │  ├─ api.ts       # Axios instance + API helpers
│  │  └─ stripe.ts    # Stripe client
│  ├─ pages/
│  │  ├─ _app.tsx
│  │  ├─ index.tsx
│  │  ├─ products/
│  │  │  ├─ [slug].tsx
│  │  │  └─ index.tsx
│  │  ├─ cart.tsx
│  │  ├─ checkout.tsx
│  │  ├─ auth/
│  │  │  ├─ login.tsx
│  │  │  ├─ signup.tsx
│  │  │  └─ forgot-password.tsx
