## 8. Deployment & CI

### 8.1 `package.json` (scripts)

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev",
    "build": "next build",
    "start": "next start",
    "lint": "eslint . --ext .ts,.tsx",
    "test": "jest",
    "cypress:open": "cypress open"
  }
}
```

### 8.2 GitHub Actions (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`)

```yaml
name: CI

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]
  pull_request:

jobs:
  build-test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: '20'
          cache: 'npm'
      - run: npm ci
      - run: npm run lint
      - run: npm run test
      - run: npm run build
```

### 8.3 Deployment

- Push to `main` → Vercel auto‑deploys.  
- Set environment variables in Vercel dashboard (`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`, etc.).

