## 10. Accessibility & SEO

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| **Meta tags** | `next/head` in `_app.tsx` or page components. |
| **Open Graph** | Add `og:` tags for product pages. |
| **ARIA** | Use Headless UI components (Dialog, Menu). |
| **Keyboard nav** | Ensure all interactive elements are focusable. |
| **Image optimization** | `next/image` with `layout="responsive"`. |

